# MCP Tool Catalog
File: mcp/docs/TOOLS.oot

Twenty tools. Results wrap as `{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"..."}]}`.

requiresCap 0 uses the session default. requiresCap 1 is FsReadCap.

| Name | Cap | Input | Purpose |
|------|-----|-------|---------|
| get_capability_graph | 0 | {} | 14-token graph JSON |
| get_orientation | 0 | {} | Codex text from OODACODEX |
| read_board | 1 | {name} | One governance board |
| get_audit_log | 0 | {tail?} | Last N audit entries |
| get_board_index | 0 | {} | 12 boards |
| summarize_board | 1 | {name, max_chars?} | Truncated board |
| compress_orient | 0 | {max_chars?} | Truncated codex |
| get_context_budget | 0 | {} | Session counters |
| estimate_chars | 0 | {text} | Character count |
| get_ooda_phase | 0 | {} | idle/orient/decide/act |
| get_decision_journal | 0 | {n?} | Substantive audit slice |
| get_redteam_realtime | 0 | {} | Live 8-gate fire |
| get_session_diagnostics | 0 | {} | Session snapshot |
| get_format_constraints | 0 | {} | RFC-0003 rules |
| validate_codex_format | 0 | {text} | Header and 256-line check |
| get_northstar | 1 | {} | NORTHSTAR.oot |
| get_rules | 1 | {} | RULES.oot |
| get_rfc | 1 | {name} | One RFC board (RFC-0001..) |
| get_practice | 1 | {name} | REDTEAM, WORKFLOW, or RELEASE |
| audit_compact | 0 | {keep_last_n?} | Drop old audit rows |

Boards: ANCHOR, RULES, NORTHSTAR, RFC-0001..RFC-0006, REDTEAM, WORKFLOW, RELEASE.
